iding Book for you to follow So we understand that yes, there are true statements in every book really Probably you're going to find true statements there, whether it's about worshiping God, Being good to your neighbor, not killing,.. all of these things You're going to find them in many books But we're talking about Guidance from God We're talking about complete guidance, absolute Truth and Guidance coming from the Creator And the last point about understanding religion, understanding Islam, and Islam is a big sea I'm learning every day!", "Everyone is learning every day I wouldn't even say it's just Islam, but I say with any probably theological thing, A theological Faith, it'll take you a never-ending time to finish these things But it's not a requirement for you to do it What you really need to do is the Foundation Does the foundation make sense to me and it is proven to be from The Creator? Or is the Foundation problematic? Is the Foundation of the Faith shaky? Like for example, the foundation of Christianity: Scripture cannot be trusted, because it's corrupted, changed, contradictions in the Book, contradictions in the creeds that are not aligned with the Scripture..", "These are the foundations of the Faith I don't need now to spend 20, 40, 50 years studying Christian theology When I know already the foundation is destroyed So, looking at the foundation, should be where you go from, And then you can learn day by day, because like I said, nobody ends and stops learning",))
