a عليه السلام he asked for help, he said; aid me, help me.", "So Musa عليه السلام came and he pushed He just pushed the guy but Musa عليه السلام was very strong, he was very strong right? So he died. He just pushed him, he did not try to kill him, he pushed him, the other person fell and died. So here Musa عليه السلام committed, what can be considered a minor sin because unintentional, he was not trying to kill him Then he straight away asked for forgiveness. He said this is from the work of Satan and then he asked Allah to forgive him straight away (Quran28:15-16)",))
